  "version": "HL7 v2.5",
  "chapter": "Order Entry",
  "description": "Left for backward compatibility only.  It is recommended that the trigger events OMG, OML, OMD, OMS, OMN, OMI, and OMP be used instead when communicating orders and order related events. \n\nThe function of this message is to initiate the transmission of information about an order.  This includes placing new orders, cancellation of existing orders, discontinuation, holding, etc.  ORM messages can originate also with a placer, filler, or an interested third part",
